### Test Reviews API

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5031/api
@userId = 1

### 1. Get all reviews (should work without authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews

### 2. Get review by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/1

### 3. Get reviews by user ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/user/{{userId}}

### 4. Create a review (requires authentication - X-User-Id header)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "title": "Amazing Stay at Hotel Adula",
  "content": "We had a wonderful time at Hotel Adula. The rooms were clean, the staff was friendly, and the mountain views were breathtaking. Highly recommend!",
  "rating": 5
}

### 5. Create another review with different rating
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "title": "Good but could be better",
  "content": "The location is great and the rooms are comfortable. However, the breakfast could use more variety.",
  "rating": 4
}

### 6. Create a review with minimum rating
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "title": "Disappointing experience",
  "content": "The room was not as advertised and the service was lacking. Would not recommend.",
  "rating": 2
}

### 7. Try to create review without authentication (should fail with 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Review",
  "content": "This should fail without X-User-Id header",
  "rating": 3
}

### 8. Try to create review with invalid rating (should fail with 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "title": "Invalid Rating",
  "content": "This should fail with rating > 5",
  "rating": 6
}

### 9. Update a review (requires authentication and ownership)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/reviews/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "title": "Updated: Amazing Stay at Hotel Adula",
  "content": "Updated content: We had an absolutely wonderful time at Hotel Adula!",
  "rating": 5
}

### 10. Try to update someone else's review (should fail with 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/reviews/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 999

{
  "title": "Trying to update",
  "content": "This should fail",
  "rating": 3
}

### 11. Delete a review (requires authentication and ownership)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reviews/1
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 12. Try to delete without authentication (should fail with 401)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reviews/2
